      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hi! Can I sit here? I'm Nadia. I started in marketing last week."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Of course, please sit down. Nice to meet you. How's your first week going?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Busy, but everyone's friendly. Did you do anything nice on the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Nothing special. I watched a soccer game with my brother on Saturday, and on Sunday I just relaxed at home. What about you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I went hiking in the mountains with some friends. My legs still hurt!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "That sounds great, but climbing a mountain is a bit too much for me! I prefer the beach, because I can swim and relax."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Ha, fair enough. Where do you usually go?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Usually to the north coast in the summer. The water is really clear there. Have you been to the coast yet?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Not yet. I only moved to the city two months ago."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Oh, you should go in June, before it gets busy. And by the way, what do you do in marketing exactly?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Mostly social media for our products. I really enjoy it."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "That sounds interesting. Oh, it's almost two. I should get back to work, but it was nice to meet you."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "You too. See you later!"
    }
